invalid type: string "Volve 15/9-F-12B Geological & Drilling Hazards Report\nSection: Extraction Failure Notes & Sandstone Geohazards\nPage 2 of 3 - GeoInsight-RigX Historical Archives\nExtraction failure notes in the adjacent sandstone layers indicate severe\ndifferential sticking at 3245m MD. The active BHA became immobilized after\na 15-minute connection due to 450 psi differential overbalance.